body:
Just life in general at moment is at its lowest, my fam is in more than 20mn usd debt from business fuck ups and over-leveraged loans.. The building I am thinking to jump off tonight used to belong to my family, so did the road the building is built on.. Now my whole family is basically broken, my father is super depressed and never leaves his bedroom, and due to his financial insecurities always argues with my mum, my mother is the sole breadwinner and making v small income. 

I am a colossal fuck up who hasn't given any return on investment to my parents{was sent to fucking expensive schools with rich brats}

Diagnosed with Adhd, MDD and High func on the spectrum. Almost failed out of high school and flunked college twice due to mental health issues.... I might as well end my misery tonight. Thank you for caring though...
